# Gzip compression and decompression per RFC 1952 (gzip) and RFC 1951
# (DEFLATE). Implements:
#   - DEFLATE decompression (inflate): stored, fixed Huffman, dynamic
#     Huffman blocks with full code length decoding.
#   - DEFLATE compression (deflate): LZ77 with lazy matching, fixed
#     Huffman encoding (no dynamic tree construction for simplicity —
#     produces valid but slightly larger output).
#   - Gzip framing: 10-byte header, CRC-32, ISIZE trailer.
#
# This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
# it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by
# the Free Software Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or
# any later version.
